<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UroMed cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UroMed cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded UroMed Corp to hold from &quot;outperform speculative.&quot;</p>
<p>-- On Monday, UroMed said it will cut 32 employees of its 188-person work force as part of initiative to reduce operating costs and to focus resources on a series of new products.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal said UroMed also guided analysts to lower projected revenue contributions from the company's &quot;Reliance&quot; product.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal said will adjust 1997 revenue estimates to $1 million from $2.96 million. But said &quot;further discussions with management are needed to assess the impact of net losses.&quot;</p>
<p>-- UroMed lost 1-3/16 to 3-5/8.</p>
